WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.375
The tests matter as much as the playbooks.

2
00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:06.662
Everything passes the strictest
lint profile and a syntax check.

3
00:00:06.662 --> 00:00:09.555
A read-only checker fails
on any ungated write,

4
00:00:09.555 --> 00:00:12.600
and its own negative tests
prove it catches them.

5
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.725
The inventory tests prove
that bad records fail.

6
00:00:15.725 --> 00:00:17.500
But be clear about the limits.

7
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.938
The tests ran on a control node only.

8
00:00:19.938 --> 00:00:23.502
The Arc, Windows, Cisco and
Infoblox paths pass lint,

9
00:00:23.502 --> 00:00:26.388
but they haven't touched those platforms.

10
00:00:26.388 --> 00:00:31.799
And the baseline is a handful of example
settings, not a C I S Benchmark profile.

11
00:00:31.799 --> 00:00:33.687
Treat them as illustrations.

12
00:00:33.687 --> 00:00:35.400
Next, the checklist.
